---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site';
---
<Base title="Terms">
  <div class="wrap page-head prose" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="notice">Draft for review. Have an attorney confirm before launch.</p>
    <h2>What a result means</h2>
    <p>"Genuine" means the code was issued by the brand through True Tag and has not shown unusual activity. "Suspicious" means the code behaves unusually. "Not found" means we have no record of the code, which does not by itself prove a product is fake. A result is information, not a guarantee or certification of the product.</p>
    <h2>Use of the service</h2>
    <p>The check is free for shoppers. Do not misuse the service, try to guess codes or interfere with it.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent the law allows, {site.legalName} is not liable for losses from relying on a result alone. If you think a product is unsafe, stop using it.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{site.email}</p>
  </div>
</Base>
